        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehu geamwaar ghoah sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Elishayda was sibaneeda, siyagi aba jeeda giinealanga sibanga. Ak gwayeesha, “Adiing'diing'da geaw ak guwi Ramot-gileyadi, ang'waanya gideeshteayda nagheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ihiti hoowa, gigasayi Yehu orjeeda Yehoshafati bea Nimshi ak guwi ak gisaji heeda orjooga ghaamwat ak giyaadi jeeda ghooriida sighuseagwa sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gigeanu gideeshteaydida bea nagheedean, ak giidalealsi uhuudaanyi nea giyeeshi, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA naamwaaraneey nagheeda huwa sugoocheanda Israeli.’ Ak giitini gidaghuuta ak gifwaji nea adishing'di.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa gheareemaneedida was sibaneedean Ramot-gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita ghwadaah goobiitpiit shirikarajeega hees. Ak gwayeesha “Geandeawi giijasi itaang'u ea shirikarajeanda haw.” Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Aba heedeabeang'a ghana aseaseeni seaniini?” Gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i Ea shirikarajeanda haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ak gawa ghoaw; goodalealsa gheareemaneedida was sibaneedean nagheeda uhuudaanyi nea gwayeesha, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli, naamwaaraneey nagheeda huwa sugoocheanda fuga NG'UTAMIIDA bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaybwara gheeh Ahabu siidaang'u haw, aba waldeayda mureandoodeanyu bea foojeanda fugeasu bea gadiyeeda was sibanga. Ea foojeanda fuga sean bea gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Yesebeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaydalas gheesean bea Ahabu ak gaydanung' goosha gilinyoo ea ng'eedeeda gil bea gheeh Ahabu; was dea mida ghealooniga ea dea manda ghealooniga aba jeeda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' gawuurji gheeh Ahabu gheeh Yerobo, orjeeda Nebati, nea gawuurji gheeh Baasha, orjeeda Ahiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwaak gudajeega Yesebeli aba ng'eanyiida Yesreeli, aba gideaba manda siida jea gabuy.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata gootin gidaghuuta ak ghafwach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gabiikta Yehu heeda fuga gadiyeeda siidaanyi haw. Ghwalamda siyagi ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Giyeani seayu? Rageananeedida gagasa naaha aba headaang'u?” Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Agooga ghoanali gidagasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Nih mii huumwa gil; rukuneasa ghamneawa.” Ak gwayeesha, “Goobaloolan nea gwayi, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA naamwaaraneey nagheeda huwa sugoocheanda Israeli.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaba sih lamwach gageanu hang'daanyi ak geabwadageat ghamiinaadawa Yehu uhuuda. Ak geeghuut durumbeati nea geeyi, “Yehu sugoocheanda gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoram sugoocheanda Israeli geenuus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu orjeeda Yehoshafati bea Nimshi, ghang'ut foolayda aba badayda Yoram. Abeeda Yoram gafuriischi sea fuga Israeli sean aba Ramot-gileyadi nea geefur Hasaeli sugoocheanda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda Yoram gabiigu ng'eanyiida Yesreeli eahaap deaneaduutkaaschi ghayi ng'ut fuga Shaamu. Damanda ghayi ng'ucheewa sea Hasaeli sugoocheanda Shaamu. Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha lugoadaanyi, “Eaniyean eesina badiida adagwarita eara siyagi aba jeedeaba mujiineani, ak ghwaat iita ng'eanyiida Yesreeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Yehu ak gwading'da mutukwajeandaanyi gawa Yesreeli, aba gideaba Yoram abeeda gudugwanda muunda aba hoowa. Nea eara Ahasiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ea nirarang'aan ghwahidu googeachi Yoram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda miinaadawa furiischoocheanda aba uhuuda gheeda geaw siikeal humng'eeda, aba Yesreeli. Ghwadaa eemeeda adeana Yehu nea ghapka, ak gwayeesha, “Ghaadaay eemeeda nea ghapka.” Ghwalamda Yoram ak gwayeesha, “Asi geani siyagi ding'da faraasi ak ginung' gawa roonyeeda nea ghoanyaash gideaba, ‘heapi ghoopkaani seayu?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa siyagi ding'da faraasi roonyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi sugoocheanda gideaba heapi! ‘Ghoopkaani seayu?’” Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i giduupi naaha seayu? Yamwa geaw eani geeshteanyu.” Hean ghoadayda furiischoocheandida iita nea gwayeesha, “Siidida eajeaktiin nihita heeda buuneeda ak ea mabiikna gicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta siinuut bea iyeenya ding'da faraasi. Amahita gwayeesha, “Gwayi sugoocheanda heapi! ‘Ghoopkaani seayu?’” Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i giduupi naaha seayu? Yamwa geaw eani geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadayda furiischoocheandida iita nea gwayeesha, “Nihita heeda buuneeda ak ea mabiikna gicha; ak beatida gawuurji beata Yehu orjeeda Nimshi, aba gideaba ghamwanmwan mutuku nea ghwalamwach.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoram ak gwayeesha, “Mwanmwana mutuku.” Hean geamwanmwan mutukwajeanda nyaawa. Ng'ata gwarita Yoram was sugoocheanda Israeli ea Ahasiya sugoocheanda Yuda nea gaba siisi mida jeeda mutukwajeandaanyi ak geeweay eeroonyi Yehu, hean geeroonyeesa seamooda Naboti siida mida Yesreeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah Yoram Yehu ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Gihini seayu Yehu?” Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Seayoomba naaha, nea hiseadayeanduumeeda geamadu was Yesebeli ea beeneetkweandumeadaanyi ea niraanya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayam geaw Yoram ak ghafwach nea gwayeesha Ahasiya, “Niyamseasa geaw Ahasiya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagis Yehu ghuweang'daanyi aba uurdaanyi sean, ak gafu geatinda Yoram ak gwarita geacheeda ea gawa jeeda gurooroadaanyi. Ak ghoabina uhuuda mutukwajeandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha Bidkari, was shirikarajeandaanyi haw, “Geanda ak guwi jaksiina seamooda Naboti mida Yesreeli, aba gideaba apkaada damanda ghayi siding'deawi faraasajeagaasa ang'iing'i ea aniini. Ak geamwaghaadi Ahabu was ghwaan, NG'UTAMIIDA abeeda gwarugu ng'asheesu aba badayda Ahabu nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Aba huumwa heeta ghaadaayi foojeanda Naboti, ea foojeanda diibigaaschi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaydawalu aba seamooni gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.’ Asi geanda musta ak gijaksi seamooni, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya sugoocheanda Yuda geenuus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah ng'asheesu Ahasiya sugoocheanda Yuda, ghafwach gawa mujiineeda Bet-hagani. Hean ghwaat Yehu geeshta nea gwayi, “Afta eara nih aba badayda mutukwajeandaanyi”; hean geefu damanda siyeang'daawa Guri, neekeewa Ibleamu. Ghafwach amahita Megido gameewsa hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ghwayiin uhuuda mutuku ak geayaat ea ghwahita Yerusalemu ak geebung'sa jeeda bung'eadaanyi deaschi gea ghweanigaaschi aba jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damwanagi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yoram orjeeda Ahabu. Hean ghoang'eat Ahasi sugoocheanduumeeda Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda was sugoocheanda siguura Yesebeli geenuus",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahita Yehu Yesreeli, hean ghwaan Yesebeli iita, hean ghwayeasha gheanyangaaschi ghuurjeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita Yehu gheata dooshta mujiini gwayeesha gatmoodida Yehu, “Gihini seayu? Heapi Simri nibwari siidaang'u hawi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagatkat Yehu uhuudaanyi googeal seawadeeda nea gwayi, “Siida bea meatkweedeanyu ng'eaha?” Ghoang'weardaawa seawadeedida gulan iyeenya ghana samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yehu ak gwayeesha, “Ajaksiina ng'eanyi.” Hean geejaksa ng'eanyi, ak goobitpisa foojeanda mwaatkwa uhuuda ghamarda, nea mwaatkwa goobitpisa badayda faraasajeega. Ak gwadataksa ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa gah amahita gweagiischi nea gwaleeshi. Ak gwayeesha, “Ang'ula gatmooni simwaashtaan, ayaada apunya aba gideaba huda sugoocheanda gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeweay nea gwachi gajeeweay eebuy, sihita geaghus geaka uhuuda ea geaka geatinga, ea gea geeshanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geebiikta ak geataw iita. Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Nih ghayi gabean gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA aba ghuuta siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Eliya siida ng'eanyiida Dishbi nea gwayi, ‘Banyeega Yesebeli gayghwaak gudajeega aba ng'eanyiida Yesreeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak musta Yesebeli gaygawuurji fiyeega aba madeeda madameega aba ng'eanyiida Yesreeli. Nea manda siida jea gwayi nih musta Yesebeli gil.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
